  "timeCompression": {
    "why": "'Wait for Veo3 Processing (5 mins)' has no parameters, so Wait v1.1 waits its default of 1 hour and n8n parks the execution in 'waiting', past the bench's timeout. Shortened to 1 second on both sides. This changes when the run resumes, not what it does: the fal mock's replies do not depend on elapsed time. Not a placeholder fill, so results flag it as time compression (config.nonPlaceholder).",
